398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (VIDHISHALA, a society registered under The Rajasthan Societies Registration Act, of 1958, has been a guiding light within the legal community since its establishment in July 2020. This remarkable organization is deeply committed to disseminating legal education, promoting awareness, and nurturing interdisciplinary discourse across various legal domains.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With a diverse membership that includes law students, legal practitioners, respected academicians, and esteemed judges, Vidhishala stands as a force dedicated to enlightening individuals about their legal rights and duties. This commitment to legal empowerment has earned Vidhishala a well-deserved place among the "Top 100 Indian Law Blogs and Websites" by Feedspot in 2021.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One of Vidhishala's significant accomplishments is the "Rajasthan Law Festival," a prestigious event held in collaboration with the Ranka Public Charitable Trust. This festival represents a landmark in the legal history of the country, underscoring Vidhishala's dedication to advancing the legal profession and fostering intellectual discourse. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Since its inception, Vidhishala has been on a mission to integrate legal aid and awareness initiatives, venturing into avenues such as legal aid, legal awareness, legal intervention, legal journalism, and legal activism. All of these initiatives are grounded in a profound socio-legal approach aimed at contributing positively to the development of society.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
