/ActualText (Prime Minister Shri Narendra Modi provided guidance that all laws enacted during the British colonial era, spanning various government departments, should be reviewed and adapted to align with contemporary times and the interests of Indian society. He personally reached out by letter to all judges of the Supreme Court, Chief Justices of all High Courts in the country, and all law universities across India. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
