>>
endobj
593 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (NO PROVISION FOR ATTEMPT TO SUICIDE)
/E (NO PROVISION FOR ATTEMPT TO SUICIDE)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
594 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Nevertheless, the BNS Bill of 2023 does not include a specific provision regarding attempted suicide, unlike Section 309 of the IPC. The new bill lacks such a provision. However, the new bill does introduce Section 224, which criminalizes an attempt to commit suicide with the intent to compel or restrain the exercise of lawful power.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
