/S /P
/ActualText (The Indian Penal Code of 1860 initially comprised 511 Sections, but the recent Bhartiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023, has reduced the total to 356 Clauses. Among these, there are several crucial Clauses that find frequent application in everyday life and play a significant role in courtroom proceedings.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
