/ActualText (Herein lies a delineation of the specific loopholes that are evident in this context, While the provisions incorporated within the BSB \(Bharatiya Sakshya Bill\) are praiseworthy, it is imperative to acknowledge that certain prevailing gaps remain inadequately rectified and warrant deeper examination.)
