784 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In Clause 165 of the Bill, there's an issue with the placement of a provision. Subsection \(3\) doesn't fit with its current context about interpreters and should instead be placed with Subsections \(1\) or \(2\), where the broader power of the court to compel document production is discussed. This change is suggested to address privileged documents involving ministers and the President of India.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
