794 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The legal system is being transformed by technology in the age of digital transformation, along with many other industries. This tendency is reflected in the new legislation that Union Minister Amit Shah has tabled, which includes measures addressing digital offenses and the use of digital evidence.)
/E (The legal system is being transformed by technology in the age of digital transformation, along with many other industries. This tendency is reflected in the new legislation that Union Minister Amit Shah has tabled, which includes measures addressing digital offenses and the use of digital evidence.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
795 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Even though the Indian Evidence Act of 1872 already permits this, the proposed addition of Clause 61 in the Bill offers much-needed clarification, particularly when read during with the proposed definition of "document," which among other things includes emails, computer logs, and messages as examples of the same. Through the planned and synchronized engagement of the entire Government, digitization in India aims to transform the country into a knowledge economy and bring about excellent governance for citizens)
/E (Even though the Indian Evidence Act of 1872 already permits this, the proposed addition of Clause 61 in the Bill offers much-needed clarification, particularly when read during with the proposed definition of "document," which among other things includes emails, computer logs, and messages as examples of the same. Through the planned and synchronized engagement of the entire Government, digitization in India aims to transform the country into a knowledge economy and bring about excellent governance for citizens)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
796 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The term "digitalization" refers to the socioeconomic changes brought about by the widespread use of digital technologies for the creation, processing, and distribution of information. The Bharatiya Sakshya Bill, 2023 clearly allows for the inclusion of electronic documents as evidence, supporting the drive for a "Digital India.")
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
