/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The new bills acknowledge the importance of digital evidence, such as emails, text messages, and social media posts. For as long as the digital evidence satisfies certain requirements, provisions have been developed to assure its admissibility in court.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
