/P 355 0 R
/Pg 38 0 R
>>
endobj
812 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It's essential to guarantee the reliability of digital evidence. The laws specify processes, including the use of digital signatures and secure protocols, for validating digital evidence.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
