>>
endobj
814 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Digital evidence must be properly preserved because it might be unstable. In order to maintain the integrity of digital evidence throughout the legal process, laws prescribe criteria for preservation.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
