1118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In Clause 482\(2\) of the BNSS, there exists an error where the previous provision allowed additional bail conditions for those accused under three specific IPC chapters. The amended provision, however, incorrectly deleted "Indian Penal Code" and replaced it with an inaccurate title. This error is particularly perplexing as the BNSS primarily pertains to procedural matters. Furthermore, the amended provision does not address offenses against the state and crimes involving women and children adequately.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
