/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (While enhancing procedural safeguards for women against arrest, BNSS Clauses 43\(5\) and the proviso under 43\(1\), which correspond to CrPC Section 46\(4\) and proviso under 46\(1\), could have been merged for streamlined application and interpretation. These were originally introduced separately in)
